<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine ASTRA approves issue of five mln shares.</title>
<headline>Argentine ASTRA approves issue of five mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine oil firm ASTRA said Thursday its board approved the issue of five million common voting shares at $10 each.</p>
<p>The shares will be offered in public tender, ASTRA told the Buenos Aires Stock Exchange without giving more details.</p>
<p>Spanish oil company Repsol has a controlling stake in ASTRA.</p>
<p>- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
